{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122714","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122714/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122714/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122714/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122714","id":5222458518,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABApqrdQ","number":122714,"title":"Style: Create static constant `EMPTY` for `String` and `StringName`","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2304948121,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMzA0OTQ4MTIx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:codestyle","name":"topic:codestyle","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":10,"created_at":"2026-08-22T14:51:56Z","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:14:45Z","closed_at":"2026-10-13T13:14:33Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122714","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122714","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122714.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122714.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nAfter #122690 made me realize that we were wasting allocations of `StringName` references, it made me wonder if we could go a step further than the solution presented in that PR. Because, while it's a fantastic solution, it still creates an individual static variable for every non-object type call. Instead of having an empty reference located at a given funtion's call site, why not formalize the `EMPTY` reference within the class itself?\r\n\r\nThis PR adds a static, publically-accessable constant of `EMPTY` to both `String` and `StringName`. This constant is a reference type, so any functions that need to pass a constant reference but also require a dummy fallback are now able to pass the built-in `EMPTY`. This should slim down our build sizes, and pave the way for cleaner code wherever these dummy references would be required.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\nIt's possible that other classes would benefit from equivalent `EMPTY` constants, but I limited it to `String` and `StringName` as they're the most obvious and readily-applicable cases that currently exist.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122714/reactions","total_count":8,"+1":8,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122714/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}